<title>USA: Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</title>
<headline>Freddie Mac to redeem debenture issue.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Home Loan Mortgage Corp said Wednesday that it will redeem a $40 million 6.00 percent fixed-rate debenture issue on October 28.</p>
<p>The issue was set to mature Nov 10, 1997, and has a cusip number of 3134AOPY2.</p>
<p>Freddie Mac said it will redeem the debenture issue in its entirety at a price equal to 100 percent of principal.</p>
<p>It said it will pay principal on the debentures along with interest accrued on the principal amount to the redemption date to holders of record as of the close of business on October 25.</p>
</text>
